  <item>
    <title>07. 夺回生活掌控感，在无序中搭建10%的秩序感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6721c4facbe0e69c8bbd51f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6721c4facbe0e69c8bbd51f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🏷本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 灵魂拷问：为什么时长感到空虚和匮乏感？是现阶段的生活缺少意义感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 【锚点1】做播客：无比享受制作节目的整个过程，选题、表达、编辑、呈现……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 做播客的契机，是宛如把黑头挨个剔除干净般，自我表达被满足的爽感；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 【锚点2】跑步：从2公里到6公里，以前觉得运动很难，内驱力让我挤时间也要出门跑步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 借由跑步，打开一种新的生活方式：冰岛马拉松？东京马拉松？要有梦想，万一实现了呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> 【锚点3】养小狗：我 终 于 养 狗 狗 了！有种梦想成真的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a> 和狗狗一起生活有很多不适应，但也积极改变着自己。我逐渐适应家里有狗子的生活节奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 焦虑空虚的终极解法：为自己创造新的生活支点</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyfWaR7j32i3kA2Cx8By_xe_8sS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvP5ALYoDOZHDNfxPDKMwasESF1h.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsFKdde7Q7Xw9Ps9swnG12T2OpkN.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llWm_xVipND3A_zluWqa3sNa5krC.m4a" length="26656030" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTDPnxSWEF1wsSCLCs52TBcoXc1.png"/>
